{"speciesId":643,"names":{"fr":"Reshiram","es":"Reshiram","en":"Reshiram","ja":"レシラム"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Un Pokémon mythique. Il projette de sa queue un tourbillon de flammes capable de tout emporter."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"This Pokémon appears in legends. It sends flames into the air from its tail, burning up everything around it."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Quand sa queue s’embrase, l’énergie thermique dégagée modifie l’atmosphère et bouleverse la météo du monde entier."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"When Reshiram’s tail flares, the heat energy moves the atmosphere and changes the world’s weather."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"This legendary Pokémon can scorch the world with fire. It helps those who want to build a world of truth."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"This legendary Pokémon can scorch the world with fire. It helps those who want to build a world of truth."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Un Pokémon légendaire assez puissant pour embraser le monde entier. Il soutient les défenseurs de la Réalité."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Pokémon legendario capaz de abrasar el mundo con sus llamas. Ayuda a quienes persiguen un mundo veraz."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"This legendary Pokémon can scorch the world with fire. It helps those who want to build a world of truth."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"炎で 世界を 燃やしつくせる 伝説の ポケモン。真実の 世界を 築く 人を 助ける。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Quand sa queue s’embrase, l’énergie thermique dégagée modifie l’atmosphère et bouleverse la météo du monde entier."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Cuando la cola de Reshiram arde, su energía calorífica altera la atmósfera, y el tiempo meteorológico cambia."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"When Reshiram’s tail flares, the heat energy moves the atmosphere and changes the world’s weather."},{"language":"ja","